{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refrain from purchasing as I am currently working on a major update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645070/extras/1224e485ae11386f0b2baa3eacd57385.avif?t=1752472201\" width=390 height=216 /></span>In the medieval magic fantasy world, the protagonist is a man who captures deserters from the kingdom and sells them back to the kingdom after punishing them behind closed doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, he hears the story of a deserter he is about to execute and begins to have doubts, and eventually stops selling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Move your hero with a point click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Equip or collect items picked up from the floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Capture enemy heroes to execute or join them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build buildings in your town to discover or upgrade abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the map's terrain and invade enemy villages to expand your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Conversely, defeat or recruit enemies who are advancing on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each hero has a level, special skills, and items with special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Items drop when enemies are defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can trade items with everyone online, join alliances, and compete between factions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2645070?t=1752472201","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2645070?t=1752472201","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752472201","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/